  "detail": "the server of 'A1' on bridge 'loopback' rejected the goal - nothing was written",
  "errorCode": "goalRejected",
  "status": 422,
  "title": "Goal Rejected",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/OperationNotSupported"
}


HTTP/1.1 200 OK
